WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.767
NOT EXISTS asks whether no matching row can be found
For each patient

00:00:06.003 --> 00:00:11.585
the inner query searches prescriptions If there is
no prescription with

00:00:11.612 --> 00:00:17.284
that patient ID the patient is returned This pattern
appears everywhere

00:00:17.455 --> 00:00:22.810
customers with no orders students with no
submissions devices with no alerts and patients with

00:00:22.836 --> 00:00:24.073
no prescription record
